Employee Manager Application

This is a Employee Manager Microservice, which Manages employees PII data. Exposes APIs: Save Employee, Save Address, save Department
save contact details, update, delete, etc.

Dev release history:
1. created Git repository, created application structure
2. created Model classes, JPA repos, wrote service logics, developed APIs.
3. Ensured Address, department, contact details rows are getting saved uniquely in DB.